  "description": "*“I didn't want to say this, but seriously... are you obsessed with peppers?”\n\n“What?”*\n\nEven at Un-o's harsh words, Ho-Beom doesn't back down. He tried his hardest to persuade him, appealing that his feelings for the guy were genuine, but Woon-Oh gave valid reasons why he couldn't accept Ho-Beom. Yet Ho-Beom was the kind of guy who could grasp a sliver of hope even in despair. In the end, for Woon-Oh, who was obsessed with ‘firsts,’ Ho-Beom decided to give him the first he could offer....\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: The second story in Metatoon's Yeonhagong Danpyeonseon (연하공 단편선) Collection.*",
